## The case simulates the Bridgman on large mesh and grain growth on smaller mesh 
## The two meshes are dynamically coupled through field interpolation


## Compile the libraries and solvers
# 1. Navigate to Bramhaguptha folder and run the command
# ./Allwclean and ./Allwmake

## Run the case:

# 1. For parallel run
# Ensure numberOfSubdomains and simpleCoeffs fields in decomposePar 
# are configured according to the processor availabe in system
# command: ./Allrun-parallel

# 2. Single core eun
# command ./Allrun 
